xt-gray-200 [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:text-gray-900 [&_h2]:dark:text-white [&_h3]:mt-6 [&_h3]:text-xl [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:text-gray-900 [&_h3]:dark:text-white [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-5 [&_li]:mt-1 [&_p]:my-4 [&_code]:rounded [&_code]:bg-gray-100 [&_code]:px-1.5 [&_code]:py-0.5 [&_code]:font-mono [&_code]:text-sm [&_code]:dark:bg-gray-800 [&_pre]:overflow-x-auto [&_pre]:rounded-xl [&_pre]:bg-gray-900 [&_pre]:p-4 [&_pre]:text-white","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Welcome to this technical guide from the <strong>Cloud &#x26; DevOps Engineering</strong> vertical at Coding Club!</p>\n<h3>Overview</h3>\n<p>How to automate testing, build artifacts, and release to edge servers in seconds.</p>\n<p>In our vertical, we focus heavily on practical project work, peer code reviews, and hands-on workshops.</p>\n<h3>Key Concepts Covered</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Docker &#x26; Containers</strong> - <strong>Kubernetes</strong> - <strong>GitHub Actions</strong> - <strong>Terraform</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Next Steps &#x26; How to Contribute</h3>\n<p>Want to write an article for this vertical?</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the <a href=\"/admin\">CMS Studio</a> portal.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Cloud &#x26; DevOps Engineering</strong> under the Vertical dropdown.</li>\n<li>Submit your draft. Once approved by our vertical head (Elena Rostova), it will be published here!</li>\n</ol>\n"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-16 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8 dark:border-gray-800","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/verticals/cloud-devops","className":"text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:underline dark:text-blue-400","children":["← More from ","Cloud & DevOps Engineering"]}],"$L1f"]}]}]]}]
